(Thus overall plan:)
(1. Release compliance certificate from shift_candidate_alpha.)
(2. Prepare origin:)
(a. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(b. confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(c. activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(d. load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(e. unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(Now origin has: prepared, locked, confirmed, node occupied/ready, cargo_available true, task profile still linked (since we didn't detach). Good.)
(3. Detach origin task profile (to free profile for destination):)
(detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now profile available, origin still has prepared, locked/confirmed, node occupied/ready, cargo_available true, but no task profile linked.)
(4. Prepare destination:)
(a. attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(b. confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(c. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(d. load_destination_payload destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(e. unload_destination_payload destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(Now destination has: prepared, locked/confirmed, node occupied/ready, cargo_available true, task profile linked.)
(5. Detach destination task profile (to free profile for origin's later uses):)
(detach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now profile available, destination still prepared, locked/confirmed, node occupied/ready, cargo_available true, no task profile linked.)
(6. Attach task profile to origin again (for origin's later uses):)
(attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now origin has task profile linked again (plus its earlier properties).)
(7. Assemble transport leg:)
(assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available. All true after steps.)
(Effect: transport_leg_assembled, origin_linked, destination_linked, not transport_leg_available.)
(8. Authorize transport leg loading:)
